  Changes made by Artificial Analysis (see README.md):
    - data/test-00000-of-00001.parquet: the `title` of 127 rubric criteria is reworded, and two
      criteria take Scale's fix from github.com/scaleapi/SWE-Atlas commit 9acc18e; every rubric item also carries
      `original_title` (Scale's text) and `change`. Questions, repositories, base commits,
      Docker images, reference answers, criterion ids, polarity and importance are unchanged.
    - rubric_evaluation_config.yaml: the judge model, voting, output schema and prompts used by
      Artificial Analysis replace Scale's judge configuration.
    - data/test/cae_qna_124_public.csv: removed; the parquet file is the single data source.

